{"choices":[{"finish_reason":"stop","index":0,"message":{"content":"```json\n{\n  \"additions\": [\n    {\n      \"unit_key\": \"Ch3:1\",\n      \"studies\": [\n        {\n          \"source_handle\": \"P0092\",\n          \"contribution\": \"提供粪便SCFA水平与抗PD-1疗效正相关的临床队列证据，确立其作为疗效预测标志物的实证基础。\"\n        },\n        {\n          \"source_handle\": \"P0503\",\n          \"contribution\": \"揭示血清丁酸/丙酸与抗CTLA-4预后负相关，阐明SCFA效应的靶点依赖性与情境反转。\"\n        },\n        {\n          \"source_handle\": \"P0515\",\n          \"contribution\": \"详述丁酸通过HDAC抑制上调Pdcd1/Cd28增强CD8+ T细胞记忆，同时提示Treg分化的双向潜力。\"\n        },\n        {\n          \"source_handle\": \"P0377\",\n          \"contribution\": \"展示缺氧微环境中癌细胞逆向摄取丁酸供能的反常现象，凸显代谢物效应的微环境阈值依赖性。\"\n        },\n        {\n          \"source_handle\": \"P0223\",\n          \"contribution\": \"补充实体瘤抗PD-1治疗中响应者fSCFA显著升高的表型数据，强化代谢物介导免疫激活的临床关联。\"\n        },\n        {\n          \"source_handle\": \"P0220\",\n          \"contribution\": \"梳理SCFA在不同浓度与癌种下的矛盾功能，为解释肠道菌群对ICI疗效的情境依赖性提供理论框架。\"\n        }\n      ]\n    },\n    {\n      \"unit_key\": \"Ch3:2\",\n      \"studies\": [\n        {\n          \"source_handle\": \"P0582\",\n          \"contribution\": \"核心文献，证实肌苷直接结合UBA6解除MHC-I抑制，并指出人体肿瘤内实测浓度缺失的关键转化缺口。\"\n        },\n        {\n          \"source_handle\": \"P0124\",\n          \"contribution\": \"阐释双歧杆菌来源肌苷经A2AR/cAMP通路促进Th1分化及作为替代碳源维持效应T细胞存活的平行机制。\"\n        },\n        {\n          \"source_handle\": \"P0584\",\n          \"contribution\": \"提供腺苷脱氨酶将免疫抑制性腺苷转化为肌苷的药代动力学数据，说明肌苷半衰期延长对微环境暴露的意义。\"\n        },\n        {\n          \"source_handle\": \"P0251\",\n          \"contribution\": \"对比生态与还原论方法，明确双歧杆菌通过肌苷-A2AR轴增强T细胞活性的分子路径，支撑机制解析。\"\n        }\n      ]\n    },\n    {\n      \"unit_key\": \"Ch3:3\",\n      \"studies\": [\n        {\n          \"source_handle\": \"P0481\",\n          \"contribution\": \"证实牛磺脱氧胆酸经TGR5受体直接增强CD8+ T细胞毒性，并在菌群失调模型中恢复ICI疗效。\"\n        },\n        {\n          \"source_handle\": \"P0180\",\n          \"contribution\": \"揭示次级胆汁酸结合非经典核受体RORγt与NR4A1，精细调控Th17/Treg平衡的分子细节。\"\n        },\n        {\n          \"source_handle\": \"P0209\",\n          \"contribution\": \"阐明色氨酸代谢物IPA通过AhR维持CD8+ T细胞干性（Tcf7超增强子），并与抗PD-1产生协同效应。\"\n        },\n        {\n          \"source_handle\": \"P0424\",\n          \"contribution\": \"提供不可切除肝细胞癌队列中次级胆汁酸丰度与更长PFS的正向关联，连接特定菌群与临床预后。\"\n        },\n        {\n          \"source_handle\": \"P0186\",\n          \"contribution\": \"基于毛螺菌科比较基因组学预测胆汁酸转化基因簇，为核受体配体生成提供菌株特异性功能线索。\"\n        }\n      ]\n    },\n    {\n      \"unit_key\": \"Ch3:4\",\n      \"studies\": [\n        {\n          \"source_handle\": \"P0444\",\n          \"contribution\": \"提供宏基因组功能通路（MEP、核黄素合成）与特定T细胞亚群（Vδ2、MAIT）活化直接关联的纵向队列证据。\"\n        },\n        {\n          \"source_handle\": \"P0220\",\n          \"contribution\": \"阐述代谢物作为表观遗传修饰底物或直接抑制HDAC，改变染色质开放性以重编程巨噬细胞与T细胞转录程序。\"\n        },\n        {\n          \"source_handle\": \"P0587\",\n          \"contribution\": \"整合多组学数据揭示微生物代谢物系统性调节宿主免疫细胞氧化磷酸化与糖酵解平衡，决定效应与耗竭T细胞命运。\"\n        },\n        {\n          \"source_handle\": \"P0363\",\n          \"contribution\": \"批判单一分类学分析的局限，主张采用多组学整合与机器学习模型捕捉代谢功能的动态变化以替代传统多样性指标。\"\n        }\n      ]\n    },\n    {\n      \"unit_key\": \"Ch3:5\",\n      \"studies\": [\n        {\n          \"source_handle\": \"P0582\",\n          \"contribution\": \"明确指出因样本完整性问题未能在人体肿瘤队列中直接检测肌苷浓度，仅能以UBA6表达作为通路活性代理。\"\n        },\n        {\n          \"source_handle\": \"P0363\",\n          \"contribution\": \"强调多数机制证据来自小鼠模型，血浆/粪便浓度不能完全代表TME暴露水平，警示跨物种外推风险。\"\n        },\n        {\n          \"source_handle\": \"P0584\",\n          \"contribution\": \"指出体外有效浓度（如100 μM肌苷）属人工设定而非内源性实测值，体内浓度受血流灌注与降解酶多重制约。\"\n        },\n        {\n          \"source_handle\": \"P0413\",\n          \"contribution\": \"从药理学角度分析代谢物在TME中的递送效率受血管通透性及转运体限制，导致全身循环与局部有效浓度脱节。\"\n        }\n      ]\n    }\n  ]\n}\n```","reasoning_content":"Here's a thinking process:\n\n1.  **Analyze User Input:**\n    *   **Role:** Academic Review Planning Editor.\n    *   **Goal:** Create a substantive, argument-driven long-form review plan. Focus on substantive knowledge and analysis for the main text. Exclude intro/outro/abstract/summary modules.\n    *   **Task:** Select available literature cases for already coordinated writing units (`unit_catalog`). Provide `source_handle` and `contribution` (30-60 Chinese characters) for each selected study per unit. The contribution should explain the specific writing purpose (explanation, comparison, background, example) based on the provided A/B summaries, direct readings, or supplements. Do not invent results. Keep original paper IDs/handles. Return JSON only.\n    *   **Input Data:**\n        *   `chapter_id`: \"Ch3\"\n        *   `unit_catalog`: 5 units (U3_1 to U3_5), all under Ch3 title \"微生物代谢物的中介作用与分子机制\".\n        *   `source_routing`: Contains routing info for many papers (P0002 to P0356).\n        *   `source_materials`: Detailed A/B summaries for ~96 papers relevant to this batch/unit catalog. I need to read through them and match them to the 5 units.\n        *   `unit_catalog` details:\n            *   `Ch3:1` (U3_1): SCFAs via HDAC/GPCR dual regulation, context-dependent effects (PD-1 vs CTLA-4, hypoxia). Cases listed: P0092, P0503, P0515, P0377, etc.\n            *   `Ch3:2` (U3_2): Inosine targeting UBA6, relieving inflammation/MHC-I suppression, TME concentration gap. Cases: P0582, P0124, P0584, P0251.\n            *   `Ch3:3` (U3_3): Secondary bile acids & tryptophan metabolites activating nuclear receptors (FXR, TGR5, AhR, RORγt) to reshape myeloid/lymphoid polarization. Cases: P0481, P0180, P0209, P0424.\n            *   `Ch3:4` (U3_4): Metabolic pathways & epigenetic landscape integration, functional pathway features > single species. Cases: P0444, P0220, P0587, P0363.\n            *   `Ch3:5` (U3_5): Gap in absolute TME concentrations, reliance on plasma/feces proxies, need for microdialysis/MSI. Cases: P0582, P0363, P0584, P0413.\n        *   I need to pick studies from `source_materials` that actually support these units' points, provide their handles, and write a concise contribution (30-60 chars) explaining their role.\n\n2.  **Map Sources to Units & Draft Contributions:**\n    *   *Unit Ch3:1 (SCFAs)*\n        *   P0092: Direct clinical evidence linking fecal SCFAs to PD-1 response/PFS. Contribution: 提供粪便SCFA水平与抗PD-1疗效正相关的临床队列证据，确立其作为疗效预测标志物的实证基础。\n        *   P0503: Shows serum butyrate/propionate negatively correlated with anti-CTLA-4 prognosis. Contribution: 揭示血清丁酸/丙酸与抗CTLA-4预后负相关，阐明SCFA效应的靶点依赖性与情境反转。\n        *   P0515: Mechanistic detail on butyrate inhibiting HDAC, enhancing CD8+ T cell memory, but inducing Tregs. Contribution: 详述丁酸通过HDAC抑制上调Pdcd1/Cd28增强CD8+ T细胞记忆，同时提示Treg分化的双向潜力。\n        *   P0377: Butyrate used as energy source by cancer cells in hypoxia/ischemia. Contribution: 展示缺氧微环境中癌细胞逆向摄取丁酸供能的反常现象，凸显代谢物效应的微环境阈值依赖性。\n        *   P0223: Another clinical link between fSCFA and solid tumor anti-PD-1 response. Contribution: 补充实体瘤抗PD-1治疗中响应者fSCFA显著升高的表型数据，强化代谢物介导免疫激活的临床关联。\n        *   P0156: Systematic review on dietary fiber increasing SCFA producers (Faecalibacterium) enhancing immunity. Contribution: 系统综述高纤维饮食富集产SCFA菌（如普拉梭菌）增强抗肿瘤免疫的跨物种证据，提供上游干预线索。\n        *   P0220: Reviews SCFAs paradoxical functions (promoting vs suppressing depending on context/concentration). Contribution: 梳理SCFA在不同浓度与癌种下的矛盾功能，为解释肠道菌群对ICI疗效的情境依赖性提供理论框架。\n\n    *   *Unit Ch3:2 (Inosine & UBA6)*\n        *   P0582: Core paper on inosine binding UBA6, CheckMate 025 cohort data, TME concentration gap. Contribution: 核心文献，证实肌苷直接结合UBA6解除MHC-I抑制，并指出人体肿瘤内实测浓度缺失的关键转化缺口。\n        *   P0124: Describes inosine from Bifidobacterium activating A2AR/cAMP-CREB for Th1 differentiation, alternative carbon source. Contribution: 阐释双歧杆菌来源肌苷经A2AR/cAMP通路促进Th1分化及作为替代碳源维持效应T细胞存活的平行机制。\n        *   P0584: ADA converts adenosine to inosine, restores NK/T cell killing, pharmacokinetics (half-life). Contribution: 提供腺苷脱氨酶将免疫抑制性腺苷转化为肌苷的药代动力学数据，说明肌苷半衰期延长对微环境暴露的意义。\n        *   P0251: Compares ecological vs reductionist methods, details inosine-A2AR axis for Bifidobacterium. Contribution: 对比生态与还原论方法，明确双歧杆菌通过肌苷-A2AR轴增强T细胞活性的分子路径，支撑机制解析。\n\n    *   *Unit Ch3:3 (Bile Acids & Tryptophan Metabolites -> Nuclear Receptors)*\n        *   P0481: TDCA activates TGR5 to enhance CD8+ cytotoxicity, restores immunity in dysbiosis. Contribution: 证实牛磺脱氧胆酸经TGR5受体直接增强CD8+ T细胞毒性，并在菌群失调模型中恢复ICI疗效。\n        *   P0180: Secondary bile acids (3-oxoLCA, isoalloLCA) regulate RORγt/NR4A1, inhibit Th17/promote Treg. Contribution: 揭示次级胆汁酸结合非经典核受体RORγt与NR4A1，精细调控Th17/Treg平衡的分子细节。\n        *   P0209: IPA activates AhR to maintain CD8+ T cell stemness (Tcf7 super-enhancer), synergizes with anti-PD-1. Contribution: 阐明色氨酸代谢物IPA通过AhR维持CD8+ T细胞干性（Tcf7超增强子），并与抗PD-1产生协同效应。\n        *   P0424: High baseline fecal secondary bile acids (UDCA, UCA) correlate with longer PFS in uHCC, linked to Lachnoclostridium. Contribution: 提供不可切除肝细胞癌队列中次级胆汁酸丰度与更长PFS的正向关联，连接特定菌群与临床预后。\n        *   P0140: Details SCFAs/bile acids via GPRs/TLRs/HDACs regulating immune activation; gut barrier integrity. Contribution: 详述胆汁酸等代谢物通过G蛋白偶联受体及表观遗传途径调节免疫细胞活化，补充全身性炎症背景。\n        *   P0186: Comparative genomics of Lachnospiraceae predicts mechanisms like bile acid conversion regulating Th17/Treg. Contribution: 基于毛螺菌科比较基因组学预测胆汁酸转化基因簇，为核受体配体生成提供菌株特异性功能线索。\n\n    *   *Unit Ch3:4 (Metabolic Pathways & Epigenetic Landscape Integration)*\n        *   P0444: MEP pathway abundance correlates with low functional dysbiosis score; HMBPP activates Vδ2 T cells via BTN3A. MAIT pathway enrichment links to poor PFS. Contribution: 提供宏基因组功能通路（MEP、核黄素合成）与特定T细胞亚群（Vδ2、MAIT）活化直接关联的纵向队列证据。\n        *   P0220: Reviews how microbial metabolites act as substrates or direct HDAC inhibitors, altering chromatin accessibility to reprogram macrophage/T cell programs. Contribution: 阐述代谢物作为表观遗传修饰底","role":"assistant"}}],"created":1791151274,"id":"chatcmpl-663c70bb-6572-9ef7-8fa3-4b03265af683","model":"qwen3.7-flash","object":"chat.completion","usage":{"completion_tokens":3522,"completion_tokens_details":{"reasoning_tokens":2048,"text_tokens":3522},"prompt_tokens":223401,"prompt_tokens_details":{"cached_tokens":0,"text_tokens":223401},"total_tokens":226923}}